msgid "Constant buffer fix"
msgstr "Constantebuffer-fix"

msgctxt "UI_MENU_FIX_C0_DESC"
msgid ""
"Fills the driver-reserved constant bank c0 (storage sizes, dispatch size, point size, base "
"instance) instead of reading zeros."
msgstr ""
"Vult de door de driver gereserveerde constantenbank c0 (opslaggroottes, dispatchgrootte, "
"puntgrootte, basisinstantie) in plaats van nullen te lezen."

